1. Pixel Perfection Community Edition (block textures)
------------------------------------------------------
Files:    public/textures/pixel-perfection/atlas.png, atlas.json,
          src/render/data/pp-colors.json (average colors derived from the textures)
Authors:  Hugh "XSSheep" Rutland (original Pixel Perfection); StonePendant,
          freejusticehere, Stingraych, Nova_Wostra, lazerl0rd (Community Edition)
Source:   https://github.com/Athemis/PixelPerfectionCE
License:  Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0)
          https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
Changes:  Only textures/block/*.png and the chest entity textures are used (no
          models, blockstates or other files). Chest faces were cut and rearranged
          from entity/chest/{normal,trapped,ender}.png. Animated textures were cut to their first frame, random and
          OptiFine variants were left out, and the tiles were packed into one
          atlas. The adapted files are shared under CC BY-SA 4.0.
Notes:    The project states that it accepts only original or compatibly
          licensed work and keeps a public list of files found to be copies of
          Minecraft textures (content_with_issues.md). The only listed file at
          the time of packing, entity/banner/globe.png, is not a block texture
          and is not included here.


